    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH7x2016-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Thereupon it was named thus.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">To the south is Mount Xǔ Yóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">tall and imposing, cut off on all four sides.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">To its north is the River Yǐng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Yáo employed Xǔ Yóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">the place where he resided still has an altar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Formerly, Prince Jìn, the crown prince of King Líng of Zhōu, loved to play the sheng (mouth organ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">composing melodies like the call of the phoenix,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">and wandered between the Yī and Luò Rivers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">The Daoist Fú Qiū Gōng took him up to Mount Sōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">for more than thirty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">he traveled back and forth to Mount Gōu Shì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Mount Gōu Shì is located nearby, to the west of Mount Sōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">During the Hàn Dynasty, there was a Daoist priest</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">who brought seeds of the palm tree from a foreign country</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">and planted them at the western foot of Mount Sōng Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">There were four trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">different from other trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">flowering three times a year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-104a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">with white, fragrant and beautiful blossoms."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Two Chambers Three Platforms</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Two Chambers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">refers to Mount Tài Shì and Mount Shǎo Shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">already detailed in the narrative.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Three Platforms Mountain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">the name was established by Emperor Wǔ of the Hàn Dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">located on Mount Sōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">the matter has already been detailed in the narrative.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">Divine Peak Heavenly Garrison</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">The "Book of Odes" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">"Lofty is Mount Sōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">towering to the heavens.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2016_CHANT_005-105a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:55:06.88+09:00">From lofty peaks descends the divine,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
